{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/15092","id":3138666465,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFL76Q867FD_h","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15092","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15092.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15092.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15092","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/15092/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/15092/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15092/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/statuses/cd3aa996d7640eaafa9d2cc6b1e883937e97454b","number":15092,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(vercel): Allow specifying ISR cached query params","user":{"login":"empoulter-uclan","id":128381217,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6bxIQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128381217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan","html_url":"https://github.com/empoulter-uclan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Changes\r\n\r\n- Adds ability to specify query parameters to pass through to an ISR route in the vercel integration\r\n- This means that pages with different query parameters will be cached separately by vercel, depending on configuration. \r\n- This is useful for rendering different page content based on the query value, while maintaining good cache coverage\r\n- This was an option long possible with the [vercel build output](https://vercel.com/docs/build-output-api/primitives#prerender-configuration-file) but which was not exposed by the integration.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n- Added new test case to test the new configuration option\r\n- Ran some manual tests in a vercel deploy to verify the correct options were passed through: the ISR page https://isr-with-query.vercel.app/one?param-1=is-allowed&param-3=not-allowed correctly consumes the 'param-1' key, but not the 'param-3' key, per the configuration.\r\n\r\n## Docs\r\n\r\nAn update to the documentation for the vercel isr config will probably be necessary to explain the added option to [here](https://github.com/withastro/docs/blob/main/src/content/docs/en/guides/integrations-guide/vercel.mdx#isr). This would pretty much just reference [the vercel config option](https://vercel.com/docs/build-output-api/primitives#prerender-configuration-file), as we are basically just passing it straight through. I'm happy to add if merged. \r\n\r\n/cc @withastro/maintainers-docs for feedback!\r\n","labels":[{"id":3559102393,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI5e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20integration","name":"pkg: integration","description":"Related to any renderer integration (scope)","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-12-31T08:30:22Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:16:02Z","closed_at":"2026-03-24T22:22:47Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"